sequenceDiagram
  actor Nurse
  actor Doctor
  participant App as Medx AI
  participant Model as HER2 and XAI
  participant LLM as Recommendation service
  Nurse->>App: Register patient
  Doctor->>App: Create case and upload image
  App->>App: Validate image
  App->>Model: Run prediction and explanation
  Model-->>App: Class, probabilities, uncertainty, heatmap
  App-->>Doctor: Present contestable evidence
  Doctor->>App: Add context and request draft
  App->>LLM: Generate structured recommendation
  LLM-->>App: Reviewable draft
  App-->>Doctor: Pending review
  Doctor->>App: Accept or reject
  App-->>Doctor: Traceable final report
